I ended up on Level 4  due to an uncontrolled level teleport away from a ki-rin, 
decided to explore the first few levels of the quest, just for fun. 
Unfortunately, I had forgotten that trap doors can occur on the quest levels, 
and soon found myself in a large, open level full of lava. I started looking for 
the stairs (I didn't have telepathy or detect monster), but before I had gone 
far, Master Kaen appeared next to me. He really does hit hard. I stepped away, 
put on my +2 ring of protection, put on my ring of levitation, and ran out over 
