quaffed a potion of extra healing, leaving full healing for even more dangerous 
situations. I didn't have any attack wands except for cold, which I could not 
use for obvious reasons. I didn't know many spells, but I did know magic 
missile. I started shooting Master Kaen with it. Zg2 Zg2 Zg2 Zg Zg2 Zg "You 
